  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Jee_advance_paper_2_Chem_Q.29_Ans_1.jpg\"/><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> in (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>THF</mi></math>), Raney  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> either can reduce all functional groups or can reduce some of the functional groups of the compound given above in the reactant side. But, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> is an example of selective reducing agent. It cannot reduce, <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Jee_advance_paper_2_Chem_Q.29_Ans_2.jpg\"/> (ester group) , <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Jee_advance_paper_2_Chem_Q.29_Ans_3.jpg\"/> (carboxylic acid group) , <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Jee_advance_paper_2_Chem_Q.29_Ans_4.jpg\"/> (epoxide group). But reduces <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> (aldehyde group) into <math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.",
